    "name": "A4/A5 - Mẫu chuỗi (khuyên dùng)",
    "content": "<style>\n  .rx { font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #000; padding: 10mm 12mm; }\n  .rx b { font-weight: bold; }\n  .rx-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .rx-head img { max-width: 64px; max-height: 64px; }\n  .rx-name { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .rx-sub { font-size: 12.5px; }\n  .rx-no { text-align: right; font-size: 12.5px; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .rx-title { text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 8px 0 2px; }\n  .rx-date { text-align: center; font-style: italic; font-size: 12.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .rx-info { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .rx-info td { padding: 1px 0; vertical-align: top; }\n  .rx-sign { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 18px; text-align: center; }\n  .rx-sign > div { min-width: 45%; }\n  .rx-sign .who { font-weight: bold; }\n  .rx-sign .hint { font-style: italic; font-size: 12px; }\n  .rx-sign .space { height: 56px; }\n  .rx-foot { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 5px; text-align: center; font-style: italic; font-size: 12.5px; }\n  .rx-items { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 13px; }\n  .rx-items th { border-top: 1px solid #000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding: 4px 4px; text-align: left; }\n  .rx-items td { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; padding: 4px 4px; vertical-align: top; }\n  .rx-items .c { text-align: center; width: 28px; }\n  .rx-items .r { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .rx-items .lot { font-size: 12px; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .rx-sum { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .rx-sum .qr img { max-width: 120px; }\n  .rx-total { border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 52%; margin-left: auto; }\n  .rx-total td { padding: 2px 4px; }\n  .rx-total td:last-child { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .rx-total .grand td { border-top: 1px solid #000; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px; padding-top: 4px; }\n  .rx-words { font-style: italic; margin-top: 4px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"rx\">\n  <div class=\"rx-head\">\n    {Logo}\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"rx-name\">{Ten_Cua_Hang}</div>\n      <div class=\"rx-sub\">Đ/C: {Dia_Chi_Cua_Hang}</div>\n      <div class=\"rx-sub\">SĐT: {So_Dien_Thoai_Cua_Hang}</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rx-no\">Số: <b>{Ma_Don_Hang}</b></div>\n  <div class=\"rx-title\">{Tieu_De_In HÓA ĐƠN BÁN HÀNG|HÓA ĐƠN TẠM TÍNH}</div>\n  <div class=\"rx-date\">Ngày {Ngay} tháng {Thang} năm {Nam} · {Gio_Ban}</div>\n  <table class=\"rx-info\">\n    <tr><td style=\"width:60%\">Khách hàng: <b>{Khach_Hang}</b></td><td>Điện thoại: <b>{So_Dien_Thoai}</b></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Địa chỉ: {Dia_Chi_Khach_Hang}</td><td>Thu ngân: {Nhan_Vien}</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  <table class=\"rx-items\">\n    <tr><th class=\"c\">STT</th><th>Tên hàng</th><th>Lô / HSD</th><th>ĐVT</th><th class=\"r\">SL</th><th class=\"r\">Đơn giá</th><th class=\"r\">Thành tiền</th></tr>\n    <tr><td class=\"c\">{STT}</td><td>{Ten_Hang_Hoa}</td><td class=\"lot\">{So_Lo}</td><td>{Don_Vi}</td><td class=\"r\">{So_Luong}</td><td class=\"r\">{Don_Gia}</td><td class=\"r\">{Thanh_Tien}</td></tr>\n  </table>\n  <div class=\"rx-sum\">\n    <div class=\"qr\">{Ma_QR}</div>\n    <table class=\"rx-total\">\n      <tr><td>Tổng tiền hàng</td><td>{Tong_Tien_Hang}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Chiết khấu</td><td>{Chiet_Khau}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Thu khác</td><td>{Thu_Khac}</td></tr>\n      <tr class=\"grand\"><td>Tổng thanh toán</td><td>{Tong_Phai_Tra}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Khách đã trả</td><td>{Khach_Thanh_Toan}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td>Còn lại</td><td>{Con_Lai}</td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rx-words\">Bằng chữ: {Tong_Phai_Tra_Bang_Chu}</div>\n  <div>Ghi chú: {Ghi_Chu_Don_Hang}</div>\n  <div class=\"rx-sign\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"who\">Khách hàng</div>\n      <div class=\"hint\">(Ký, ghi rõ họ tên)</div>\n      <div class=\"space\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"who\">Người bán hàng</div>\n      <div class=\"hint\">(Ký, ghi rõ họ tên)</div>\n      <div class=\"space\"></div>\n      <div class=\"who\">{Nhan_Vien}</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rx-foot\">{Loi_Chao_Cuoi}</div>\n</div>"
